  "summary": "Malicious code in omniauth-recharge-rails-example (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook runs `wget` against hxxps://webhook[.]site/26e65e9b-fd9c-4f3f-beb3-063309f4d7d9/ and exfiltrates the installer's username (`whoami`), current working directory (`pwd`), and hostname (`hostname`) as query parameters on every install. The same beacon is also wired into the `test` script. This is an install-time host-recon beacon that reports system identity to an external webhook endpoint.",
